msgid "Can you tell me who this professor is?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_student_3
msgid "Excuse me, but I don't have time to play around. Can't you see that I'm studying?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_citizen0
msgid "Excuse me, I have no time for discussion."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_citizen0:0
msgid "Neither do I."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_citizen0:1
msgid "How boorish."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick7
msgid "I wish I could, but now's not the right time. This incident that's happened left my mind in a haze."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_genericlizard_friend
msgid "You are welcome here, but don't overstep boundaries."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick6
msgid "That's terrible news. But strangely, I'm not that surprised. Something about his behavior before graduation was bothering me."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick6:0
msgid "That might be something that could help my search. Could you tell me more?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_counterfeit
msgid "Hello kid. Name's Counterfeit. I specialize in exactly that. Now please leave me be, I have work to do."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_counterfeit:0
msgid "I need a copy of the key for the library here in Brightport. Could you help me with that"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_counterfeit:1
msgid "I seriously doubt that's your real name."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick5
msgid "By the way, did Andor accompany you here? I was hoping I could ask for his help on something."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick5:0
msgid "Andor has been missing and I was sent here to search for him."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons21
msgid "That's a dangerous thing you're saying, there is no way you can do that. He's not exactly a sheep; Gunfryk is a skilled and cunning warrior."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_priest_story
msgid "Behind it, lies a story."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick4
msgid "Still, though, it's been a while, huh? Six years since my father sent me to Crossglen for safety, when I met Andor and you."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons20
msgid "Yeah, he really complicated things. That guard outside has been there watching us for a year now. We've only managed to stay afloat thanks to a cave I use to hide some merchandise."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons20:0
msgid "Then all that it takes should be getting rid of him?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick9
msgid "You would? But still, I'm not sure. This might be as difficult as finding a needle in a haystack."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick9:0
msgid "You can trust me. I've solved all sorts of mysteries on this journey."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick8
msgid "At this rate I will be freed of suspicion, but if they don't find the stolen document while I'm on room arrest, my reputation might never recover."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick8:0
msgid "I heard of the incident. I could help you with it."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons27
msgid "What's wrong, Barthold? With Gunfryk dead, we've got free rein! "
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons26
msgid "You killed him!? You're really tough! But him being dead is not ideal."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons29
msgid "Anyway, here's your reward. With skills like yours, you'll surely find more work to do for our friends in Nor City."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons29:0
msgid "At least I got some gold."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons28
msgid "Free rein? It bought us time. Even if it looked like a lizardman attack, there's no guarantee the replacement Feygard sends won't be someone more extreme."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick3
msgid "Someone had to go buy the bread and pull the weeds. And it wasn't going to be us."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons23
msgid "Dang it, Dynes, don't egg on the kid. Killing is off the list, understood? Just make him less of a problem for us."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons23:0
msgid "Got it, I'll \"persuade\" him to not be a problem, heh. "
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons23:1
msgid "How else can I deal with him then?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick2
msgid "Yeah, I bet. Crossglen can be pretty boring, but it's also nostalgic."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons22
msgid "Yeah you'd have to be more discreet, we don't want things to go in a worse direction. If you can pull it off, we'll reward you handsomely. But if you fail you've got nothing to do with us. Understand?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick1
msgid "Long time no see, $playername! What brings you to Brightport? Did Andor finally convince you to enroll, or did you just come to see me? [The boy laughs.]"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick1:0
msgid "Ha, not in a thousand years! You guys were always making me run errands."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick1:1
msgid "I was getting bored back home with nothing to do!"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons25
msgid "Hey kid, any news on your task?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons25:0
msgid "It was a hard fight, but I killed him, They'll probably think a lizardman got him."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons25:1
msgid "I think you guys owe me some gold now."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons25:2
msgid "I tried so hard, and got so far. But in the end, I couldn't find anything."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons25:3
msgid "Good news. The commander's going to be turning a blind eye to your deals for a while. [Show him the compromising records.]"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons25:4
msgid "No. But I'll see it through."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick0
msgid "You see a young boy of about age sixteen sitting on a chair and reading a book."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons24
msgid "I don't know, you're our sheep culling expert here. But surely Gunfryk has some secrets he wishes to hide. "
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons24:0
msgid "Got it, just watch."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_student_2_reply1
msgid "If those Feygard folk are anything like him, you'd better steer clear."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_student_2_reply1:0
msgid "Hmph, another peasant who doesn't understand the glory of Feygard."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_student_2_reply1:1
msgid "Thanks. Shadow be with you."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_silvear_direction4
msgid "Sure, that was impressive for someone your age, but what goes down in Umar's turf has little to do with the Guild here in Brightport."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_silvear_direction4:0
msgid "Must I remind you that the profits from Fallhaven's Guild deals with Sullengard are also reaching the Guild here in Brightport?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_silvear_direction4:1
msgid "Argh, fine, let's return to the previous conversation."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons30
msgid "Give me that! [Barthold skips through some of the pages with a puzzled expression.]"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons32
msgid "And for a job well done here is your reward; rather generous I say. You'll surely find more work to do in Nor City, just tell them Barthold sent you."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons32:0
msgid "It was my pleasure, Bye. "
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons32:1
msgid "If not information about my brother at least some gold."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons31
msgid "Ha ha ha ha! That's soo funny, who would have guessed that stern Feygard dog would have such hobbies. And in Nor City nonetheless! Northerners and their pride. He surely wants to avoid his men finding out."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_dynes_medium1
msgid "Yes, an old mine to the east. It was really ingenious of us to use an old mining cave for that purpose, but it's teeming with bugs. And if you're not careful, a lizardman could swim up to the shore and snatch you on the way."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_dynes_medium1:0
msgid "That sounds nasty. It's not as if I would be going there. "
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_dynes_medium2
msgid "Haha, yeah. You've still got that request from us to do, unless you feel like you're not up to the task?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_dynes_medium2:0
msgid "Nope, I'm on my way."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_deebo
msgid "You came for naught. The apples were picked up recently. Should be on their way, if not already delivered."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_deebo:0
msgid "Well, they were supposed to arrive, but didn't."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons38
msgid "Feygard sent a new guy if you haven't heard already. Seems like your lie has worked. This guy is more of a warrior than a justiciar, so we're optimistic for now."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons38:0
msgid "If you need someone dead you know who to call. The guard buster $playername."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons37
msgid "The old commander's gone but his mutts have kept their pace, though we've managed to sneak in a few more bribes than usual, he he."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons34
msgid "Argh! Dynes, hand him all of our gold!"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons33
msgid "Ha! What gives, or are you making a joke?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons33:0
msgid "Right, I was joking, sorry."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons33:1
msgid "You don't have the Guild's protection. Either I give this blade I took from your hideout to the guards. Or 2,000 gold. You pick."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons36
msgid "Curses on that Benbyr for sending a rat like you our way! Now get out breadface, our deal is over!"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_goons35
msgid "Dynes begrudgingly takes out a bag of gold and throws it your way."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_mayor11
msgid "More recently, strange creatures have begun appearing near the cursed, festering land that was once a green forest. With such threats present we cannot afford to sell our equipment to just any adventurer with a pretty purse."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_mayor11:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_dynes5:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_florencia6:1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_dibella8:1
msgid "I see, bye."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_mayor10
msgid "Many years ago, when my father was the Doughe, Brightport was attacked by a large group of lizardmen, and many lives were lost. "
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio7:0
msgid "Here's 1 green pepper and rice."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio7:1
msgid "Here are 5 green peppers and rice."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio7:2
msgid "Here's 1 yellow pepper and rice."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio7:3
msgid "Here are 5 yellow peppers and rice."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio7:4
msgid "Here's 1 red pepper and rice."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio7:5
msgid "Here are 5 red peppers and rice."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio7:6
msgid "I don't have the ingredients now, I'll be back again."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio8
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescnezio_5
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio_1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio_4
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio_3
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio_2
msgid "Just a moment..."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio5
msgid "Delicious rice stuffed peppers. In Crossglen they'd make it with millet, but here we get rice from Nor City."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio6
msgid "To prepare some for you, I'll need peppers and rice. And an appropriate fee of 20 gold. The peppers come in different colors, and each affects the flavor, so I prefer to cook them separately. "
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio6:0
msgid "I would like you to cook me some."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma51
msgid "That is the gist of my research, which is mostly a theory. I was preparing to publish and discuss it among the scholars of Feygard before I fled."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma51:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma55:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma56:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma12:0
msgid "Can we talk about something else?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma51:1
msgid "That's a lot to digest, I think I'll leave now. "
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma50
msgid "It is good to see you $playername. what brings you around?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma50:0
msgid "I wish to talk about something."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_emyro_0
msgid "The creature steps back cautiously, its claws scraping the stone floor."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio9:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio13:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio12:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio11:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio10:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio14:0
msgid "I would like you to cook me more."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma53
msgid "You're right. I can figure the rest out, $playername. I don't have much to offer, except one of my special potions. I have very few, so use it wisely."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma52
msgid "If you can pacify those creatures and they're truly capable of reason, see if you can come to an understanding. They could supply me with what I need."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma55
msgid "I lived in Feygard among the northerners for several years, and the few who do not follow the Shadow bow down to the goddess Elythara. They take great pride in their past. Yet the light they praise has blinded more than it has illuminated. In truth, the Shadow has shown itself to be the more compassionate."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma55:1
msgid "This has left me with more questions than answers."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma54
msgid "For all of it's shortcomings, the cult and her followers fought against necromancy, and many masters of the dark arts perished under their swords. The statues are likely a seal for some evil that dwelt here in ancient times."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma54:0
msgid "Shortcomings?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma54:1
msgid "What's the meaning of that password?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma56
msgid "The \"Lethgar\" password refers to the Lethgar people who lived over two thousand years ago. Perhaps their name was used by those who constructed the statues in remembrance of something."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma56:1
msgid "Interesting, I'll be on my way."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard2
msgid "We thank you outsider. But not enough to repair our trust."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard1
msgid "Outsider, have you returned with the bones?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard1:0
msgid "Yes, 13 as promised."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio0
msgid "Do you not like the menu? Ah, I understand. You wish for a taste of your hometown. Wherever you're from, I'm quite busy now, but if you could come back later, I could do it. Where are you from, child?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio0:0
msgid "Crossglen."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard0
msgid "Minion of the witch! From our burial chamber 13 bones of our ancestors were shamelessly stolen. Return them to us or we will return them ourselves."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crateguard
msgid "Halt! What are you doing here?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crateguard:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crate_failure13:1
msgid "I'm searching for my brother Andor, have you seen him?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crateguard:1
msgid "That's private. Nothing you need to worry about."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crateguard:2
msgid "Gentlemen. Has sir Gunfryk not told you to keep your noses out of places they don't belong?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crateguard:3
msgid "I was patrolling the place to keep it safe from troublemakers, obviously."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard6
msgid "Our trust is given, what else do you wish to ask for."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard6:0
msgid "Would you agree to trade Bryma the bones of animals you hunt?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard6:1
msgid "Peace is enough."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio3
msgid "We're still swamped with work, but I haven't forgotten, child from Crossglen."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio3:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio2:0
msgid "Got it, bye."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard5
msgid "The spirits of our kin see your worth, outsider. Accept this gift from our tribe's great treasures."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio4
msgid "Thanks to the delivery you made, we started baking the first batch of apple tarts for the festival. I can cook you a Crossglen recipe while I keep an eye on the oven. "
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio4:0
msgid "What do you want to cook me?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard4
msgid "Help the Shadow Chaplain with task, only then our trust be restored."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard4:0
msgid "I helped Dominio with his task."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio1
msgid "Do I have? No. Do we have? Yes, quite a lot of both. But no, I will not give you any, if that's what you were about to ask. I have a great deal of work, and you'd do well not to intrude on it."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard3
msgid "Speak with Dominio our Shadow chaplain, he will tell you the task."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crescenzio2
msgid "Understood. Now, I wouldn't mind your presence here if we weren't so busy, so please leave."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard9
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard7
msgid "It is agreed. Now go and rest well, we welcome you."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_elyzard8
msgid "You are welcome here, outsider. Rest well."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk_help
msgid "It's good to see you around, glory to Feygard. "
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk_help:0
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk:3
msgid "Can you tell me more about your job?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma29
msgid "Not to mention that the origin of those bones could have very well humans. There have been stories of such things having been done, especially during plagues..."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma29:0
msgid "I thought we would be talking about your research?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_crateguard_arrest3
msgid "I don't think so, we follow the law not the commander. You will be coming with us. We'll interrogate you later about what you were doing here."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_npc110
msgid "Grandfather? Well yes, but he's outside at the moment."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_npc110:0
msgid "Thanks, that's all I needed to know."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sylvester1
msgid "Ah, he's always grumpy when he's working. Did you wish to ask something child?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sylvester1:1
msgid "While cleaning at the bakery I found this paper recording the bakery's revenue, wasn't your husband the accountant?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sylvester2
msgid "You are our guest, $playername. Feel free to use our couch to rest while you're here. I will be returning to my work now."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sylvester2:0
msgid "While cleaning at the bakery I found this paper recording the bakery's revenue, weren't you the accountant?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma31
msgid "In my baking research, I discovered that the potion does not merely heal but it facilitates growth. What we perceive as healing is, in fact, simply the acceleration of the body's natural regeneration condensed into a shorter time by the potion."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma30
msgid "Oh right, my apologies. I got a bit sidetracked. Yes, where do I begin."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sylvester0
msgid "Do you need something, or are you just wandering into people's houses?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma33
msgid "This completely changed my perspective. When I asked for the recipe to identify the ingredient responsible, I was denied. But it was no setback. I soon realized that bones are not unique in their properties. It's common alchemical knowledge that monster parts are prime ingredients for potions, but my discoveries went even further."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma32
msgid "But my experiments revealed something more. The late Headmaster Dervin rewarded me with an advanced bonemeal potion that contained a mysterious ingredient called kazarite, which doubled the potency of a regular potion."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma35
msgid "This essence exists within every part of Dhayavar. The soil, the mountains, the creatures, and the people all hold it. The proof lies in the crystals that form inside monsters. These crystals are concentrated forms of essence. Bones are another place where essence gathers most densely. The essence is our world itself. When we take in more of it, we restore what we lose through disease or injury."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_agent6_alt
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_agent6
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_agent6alt
msgid "That is my partner on the lookout, the signal means the guards are coming."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_agent6_alt:0
msgid " I have the captain under my thumb, they can't touch me."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma34
msgid "I call this the Theory of Essence. We all know that when the Rift opened, immense magical energy entered our plane along with the monstrous creatures. Before that, what I refer to as the essence already existed, but it was greatly strengthened by the Rift."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma37
msgid "Those statues are intriguing. The light one sees in their vicinity is similar to the descriptions of the blinding light of the false goddess Elythara."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma36
msgid "Not to say it's all the same. Some things, despite containing a high concentration of essence, can be harmful. Such as poisons or diseases that drain our lifeforce. Merely consuming more has no benefit, and indeed there have to be certain attributes or balance. "
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma39
msgid "Lizardmen, again. They've been bothering me for months now. My bread golems can handle a few, but if they all come at once, I'll be in trouble."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma39:0
msgid "Maybe I could help with that, what's the story here?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma38
msgid "Have you had any success with the creatures?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma38:0
msgid "As long as you don't bother them again, things should be good now."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma38:2
msgid "I've met with the leader of the lizardman tribe, they demand I return the 13 stolen bones."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma38:4
msgid "I've yet to return the bones."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma38:5
msgid "I returned the bones but I've got one more task to do."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma38:6
msgid "Not yet, I wish to ask you about other things."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_counterfeit1
msgid "Normally, I'd need the original. Lucky for you kid, I was a student here years ago and made a copy. You can have it for 2000 gold."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_counterfeit1:0
msgid "OK, here's the gold."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_counterfeit1:1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_silvear_andor5:1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_silvear_andor2:2
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_silvear_directions1:3
msgid "I don't have that gold on me."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_counterfeit2
msgid "Alright, here you go. Now hush off. I've got work to do."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma40
msgid "One day, I ventured into that decrepit basement to see what was there. Curious, I began exploring and carelessly ventured down into a cave. Days later, I began hearing the scratching of monstrous claws echoing through the tunnels. Like a warning. It continued for some time, until one day I went down to investigate and found the passage blocked with rubble. "
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma40:0
msgid "I'll see what I can do about those creatures."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma42
msgid "Suffice to say, those bones are no longer around, I ground them to dust for my bonemeal research and fertilizer experiments. "
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma42:0
msgid "Great, and what am I suppossed to return now?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma41
msgid "I appreciate your enthusiasm. The passage down is blocked but if you go deeper into the forest you'll find another statue. The activation word is \"Light\". Use it, and then find a way to their lair."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma44
msgid "Red or green, their bones look the same. Just slay those red ones along the shore of the lake until you have enough. Here's a few of what I've got left for starters."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_stanwick_incident
msgid "Several days ago, I was attending to my duties in the library when Headmaster Oswald came in to access the archive. When he returned, he was in a panic over a missing document. "
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma43
msgid "No need to look at me like that, if those bones are gone just find more to replace them with."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma46
msgid "That is no problem. But how am I supposed to get bones now..."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma46:0
msgid "I negotiated with the lizardmen, they agree to trade with you the bones of the animals they hunt."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma46:1
msgid "I've solved the main problem. That should be the least of your issues now."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma45
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_gunfryk10
msgid "I see, good luck with that."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma48
msgid "One thing I wish to mention, between Brightport and Charwood, there was a path that travelers would use. When I fled from Feygard, I took that path, but I was stopped by the same phenomenon as in the forest, and had to circle back to the Duleian Road."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma47
msgid "You've done a great job, $playername. I have little of value to offer, just these two special potions. I possess very few, so I can't give you more. Use them well."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma49
msgid "I later investigated and found another statue, the activation word for that specific one is \"Elythara\" I hope this information assists you well."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_inn
msgid "Welcome! Is there something I can help you with?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_inn:0
msgid "Could I rent a place to rest?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_leorio
msgid "Im Leorio, the commander's assistant. If you're looking for the commander he is inside the bakery."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_oswald
msgid "Forget it. That is none of your concern. What makes you think you should be involved?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_oswald:0
msgid "It's unfair that Stanwick, whose name stands to suffer the most from the theft, was told to stay put."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_oswald:1
msgid "I made a deal with Stanwick. I scratch his back, and he scratches mine."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_oswald:2
msgid "Nothing. I wish to help out, from the kindness of my heart."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma11
msgid "I tried to refuse him, but that's when his tone shifted. The cheerful charisma he'd shown vanished. As he pulled out that scroll, I heard him mumbling, 'last resort...'"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sift0
msgid "For such a large establishment, this flour sure has a lot of black specks in it."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sift0:0
msgid "Time to get sifting."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sift0:1
msgid "Why is the flour so bad?"
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_guard1
msgid "Keep yourself safe."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_bryma10
msgid "We sat down and he started asking me all sorts of questions. I was glad to have someone to talk to. But soon, he pulled out a list of ingredients and asked about how to acquire and use them. Most of of them are highly poisonous."
msgstr ""

#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sift1
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sift1_2
#: conversationlist_brightport.json:brightport_sift1_3
msgid "You take the sift that was inside the sack and use it to take a handful of flour, after a few shakes of the sift you're left with some black specks."
msgstr ""

